      "tag": "Left to Right",
      "h2": "Mistake: ignoring left-to-right",
      "body_html": "<p>For <strong>8 − 3 + 2</strong>, you must go left to right.</p><p>8 − 3 = 5, then 5 + 2 = <strong>7</strong>. Not 8 − 5 = 3 (wrong).</p>"
    },
    {
      "tag": "Division First",
      "h2": "Mistake: doing add before multiply",
      "body_html": "<p>For <strong>2 + 3 × 4</strong>, multiplication is done first.</p><p>3 × 4 = 12, then 2 + 12 = <strong>14</strong>. Not (2 + 3) × 4 = 20 (wrong).</p>"
    },
    {
      "tag": "Brackets Carefully",
      "h2": "Mistake: forgetting brackets",
      "body_html": "<p>For <strong>10 − (4 + 2)</strong>:</p><p>Brackets first: 4 + 2 = 6.</p><p>Then 10 − 6 = <strong>4</strong>. Not 10 − 4 + 2 = 8 (wrong).</p>"
    }
